\title{Looking Forward}
\author{dhsorens}
\date{2025-09-03}

\p{
    I am currently looking for the right place to really settle in and produce world-class work, with a world-class team.

    My ideal job would:
    \ul{
        \li{Produce something lasting, meaningful and world-class, in collaboration with peers and colleagues.}
        \li{Be a constant process of honing expertise, with active input, with the ability to communicate that with colleagues and/or clients.}
        \li{Consist mostly of deep, focused work with relatively few interruptions.}
    }
}
